  "remarks": "As of mid-2014, Syria-based senior military commander and shura council member of Islamic State in Iraq and the Levant, listed as Al-Qaida in Iraq (AQI) (QDe.115). Led approximately 1,000 foreign fighters for ISIL and committed a number of attacks in northern Syria. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/notice/search/un/5843242. Syria, located in as at Dec. 2014",
